{{also|Wassen|Wassén|Waßen}}
==Dutch==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|nl|/ˈʋɑ.sə(n)/}}
* {{audio|nl|Nl-wassen.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|nl|ɑsən|s=2}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|nl|dum|wasschen}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|wascan}}, from {{inh|nl|gmw-pro|*waskan}}, from {{inh|nl|gem-pro|*waskaną}}, ultimately from {{der|nl|ine-pro|*wed-||water, wet}}.

====Verb====
{{nl-verb}}

# {{lb|nl|transitive}} to [[wash]], to [[clean]]
#: {{uxi|nl|Ik ga mijn kleren '''wassen''' in de wasmachine.|I am going to '''wash''' my clothes in the washing machine.}}
#: {{uxi|nl|Vergeet niet je handen te '''wassen''' voor het eten.|Don't forget to '''wash''' your hands before eating.}}
#: {{uxi|nl|Ik moet de auto even '''wassen''' voordat we op reis gaan.|I need to '''clean''' the car before we go on a trip.}}

