===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|nl|dum|wassen}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|wassan}}, from {{inh|nl|gem-pro|*wahsijaną||to increase}}, from {{der|nl|ine-pro|*h₂weg-||to increase}}.

====Verb====
{{nl-verb}}

# {{lb|nl|intransitive|archaic}} to [[grow]], to [[rise]], to [[increase]], to [[become]] [[high]]er and/or [[big]]ger, to [[wax]]
#: {{uxi|nl|de '''wassende''' maan|the '''waxing''' moon}}

